{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &lt;<strong>Dirty Laundry&gt;</strong> \u2013 a quirky little desktop game all about <strong>socks, cleaning, and the most outrageous collections</strong> you can imagine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, your <strong>only tool is your mouse</strong>.<br>Simply <strong>move it around</strong>, and you\u2019ll start pulling socks out of a mysterious <i>\u201cSock Dimension\u201d</i>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ordinary sports socks</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute, stylish stockings</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ridiculous shoe-socks</strong>...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even <strong>strange, bizarre things</strong> that\u2026 well, <strong>aren\u2019t even socks at all</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss everything you collect into your <strong>washing machine</strong> and clean them up!<br>Freshly washed socks turn into <strong>gold coins</strong>, which you can use to <strong>upgrade your washing machine</strong> \u2014<br>transforming it from a <strong>beat-up old clunker</strong> into a <strong>high-tech, futuristic sock-cleaning beast</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your washing machine <strong>evolves</strong>, the socks you find will get <strong>wilder, crazier, and more ridiculous</strong>.<br>Before long, you might start to <strong>question what truly counts as a sock</strong>\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a <strong>collector at heart</strong>, an <strong>upgrade addict</strong>,<br>or just someone who loves watching socks fly all over the screen,<br><strong>Dirty Laundry</strong> will give you a <strong>relaxing yet addictive sock-filled adventure</strong> \u2014<br>all with just a simple flick of your mouse!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027630?t=1758457853","background_raw":"https://sto